    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What is heard",
     "texto": [
      "To say that something is heard, without you doing it, use **들리다** (to be heard, can be heard): 듣다 → **들려요** (can be heard).",
      "무슨 소리가 **들려요**? = what noise can be heard?"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What is known",
     "texto": [
      "**알려지다** (to become known) comes from **알다**: 이름이 **알려졌어요** = its name has become known. **쓰이다** (to be used) and **쓰여 있다** (to be written) come from **쓰다**.",
      "간판에 **쓰여 있어요** = it is written on the sign."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
